    <comment>Phase 30 step 30.0 blend-mode fixture. T_CHOICE_LayerMethod values below are NOT invented:
      each exact string was confirmed by grepping real, author-created xLights .xsq show files on the
      verification machine (C:\xLights\*.xsq, versions 2020.47-2026.17 inclusive, installed build
      2026.17). See implementation-evidence/PHASE-30-blend-mode-baseline.md for the full evidence
      trail, including which values were independently reconfirmed in a 2026.17-authored file. This
      file's own grammar (EffectDB dedup table + ref-indexed EffectLayer placements) mirrors that same
      real-file structure and the Studio's own XsqExporter/XsqStructuralReader convention
      (golden-three-effect-sequence.xsq), not an invented layout. The head/version value below is
      stamped 2026.03 to match this build plan's pinned target version, per the same convention as
      golden-three-effect-sequence.xsq; the actual verification evidence was gathered against the
      2026.17 install present on this machine (no exact-2026.03 install was available) -- see the
      evidence file for that gap recorded transparently.</comment>
    <sequenceTiming>25 ms</sequenceTiming>
    <sequenceType>Animation</sequenceType>
    <mediaFile></mediaFile>
    <sequenceDuration>8.000</sequenceDuration>
    <imageDir></imageDir>
